{"v":3,"desc":"《忍者茶茶丸 合集》是包含古典名作遊戲《忍者茶茶丸》系列五款作品與新作《茶茶丸妖怪大決戰》的合集遊戲。\n\n包括菜單、遊戲內的 MUSEUM、COLLECTION與新作《茶茶丸妖怪大決戰》支援繁體中文，透過累積 COIN 解鎖 20 種以上各種角色或者追加畫廊和 BGM 等準備了多重功能。並支援雙人遊玩功能。\n\n■ 收錄作品\n- 《茶茶丸妖怪大決戰》（新作）\n- 《忍者茶茶丸》（1985）\n- 《茶茶丸大冒險》（1986）\n- 《茶茶丸忍法帳》（1989）\n- 《茶茶丸擊魔傳 夢幻金魔城》（1990）\n- 《忍者茶茶丸 銀河大作戰》（1991）","publisher":"H2 INTERACTIVE","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["街機","動作","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a9c081509e1eec2d556a12c369f7396638172d1246bf74ecff9d022797a1d74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8612bc5d92e52ec01e652704bbea4b370d937857452bf69c20ceab025a2331bd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/874b19f79cd77e36d76041e775514ed04b17f99a5a061bef8546a467f7f489cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1fc2c809c2f826849bf98acf17abc98a69a180cd1cdb0f3cd1494bd32ba58bb4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee6da162ee27e1fe130051d40018a658565c2ca82db63fa00225a7f989d6f35a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/592397641d4855ca81f0c23d7eaaff18356bc6788865a6db8bc3f031960cd2cf.jpg"],"titleId":"01008ec00fdaa000","dlc":[]}